It's great for saving your life if you make a false move and literally
end up in deep water. But beware, upon contact with water any item
that is not rustproof will become *very* rusty and scrolls will fade -
to my dismay :-(. So, the AoMB is not an item to use for wading
through water unless you are prepared.

